🎯 Overview: Building the Foundation

This path provided a solid, holistic understanding of the cybersecurity landscape, covering the five core functional areas that underpin all security programs: Identify, Protect, Detect, Respond, and Recover (based on the NIST Cybersecurity Framework).

This foundational knowledge is crucial for understanding how my technical skills (e.g., from the SOC Level 1 path) fit into a larger organizational security strategy, making me a more well-rounded and business-aware professional.

